title: Janus
text: A DOPPLER shifts the colour of light that passes through it from the side: one way it turns red to blue, the other way red to green. Two red beams meet head on; the same doppler shifts each of them differently.
trick: one doppler hit from opposite sides shifts the two beams in opposite directions
motif: two-faced head: two lasers facing each other on one upright line
---
